  "description": "Watch now | The melt-up played out as expected. Now the blow off top. Now I’m watching what could offer an even bigger opportunity: silver.",
  "body_html": "<p>Agree or disagree about the melt-down, that is your choice. But what none of us can deny at this point:</p><ol><li><p>The melt-up has occurred. The S&amp;P 500 performed beautifully from 2022 to 2025, despite most American’s struggling. Fact ✅</p></li><li><p>Their is strong evidence that we are in the blow-off top. The angle of ascent for the S&amp;P 500 is getting to, long term, unsustainable rates. The money printer is back in action with the war in Iran. Bears are continuously being squeezed. </p></li><li><p>We discussed Finance, back in February, having a large run… largely due to Israel. What happened? The StockTok ETF tripled the S&amp;P 500 performance. There is a <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF 2.0</a> if you are interested. </p></li><li><p>We discussed, almost <em><strong>EXACTLY 1 year ago</strong></em>, that retail sector would be a major indicator of a meltdown. Looks like I was 5 days off. Walmart tanked yesterday and broke macro structure. </p></li></ol><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png\" width=\"467\" height=\"390\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:390,&quot;width&quot;:467,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:239840,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/212145251?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DIb4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5890581f-3d93-4d22-b3ec-9d4ef51264f3_467x390.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">This article I discussed “recession proof” sectors, not holding, falling off a cliff, as a major clue for the meltdown. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Can I guarantee a meltdown? No. But there is little evidence to sway my mind. The forecasts keep coming to fruition. </p><p>But this post is NOT to scare you. In fact, my mind is at: </p><h4><em><strong>“Where can we make the most money?”</strong></em></h4><p>We have also discussed at length precious metals, particularly silver. If gold runs, then likely so will silver, and likely so will miner companies…which will likely offer far higher % changes. That these will have more time, more runway, than things like the S&amp;P 500 (which I still think has more runway upwards but not as much as precious metals [lead/lag event]). The S&amp;P 500 will act as our clue for precious metals. </p><p>Not that I like timing bottoms…but since my <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/is-this-rally-finally-real\">July 31<sup>st</sup> Silver Update</a>, precious metals have been trending upwards again…just like crypto did in 2021 in its final leg. Tickers like <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SLV&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> I think have plenty of room to the upside. </p><p>But the big money, in my opinion, is going to be made in the miners. </p><p>One popped up on my screener yesterday, with a fresh 52 day high AND 52 week high breakout (trend is friend). This company is cash flow positive and EPS climbing both annually and quarterly. This is another winning setup…</p><h4>The stock is…</h4>",
